      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The grove survived earthquakes, political shifts, and massive urban growth, remaining one of Lima’s most beautiful and historically significant green spaces.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
