      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "San Isidro was officially created on April 24, 1931, separating from Miraflores along with the Orrantia and Country Club neighborhoods.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
