      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Since the 1990s, San Isidro has become a major financial quarter, hosting many banks and corporate headquarters in modern office blocks.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
